{
 "_about": "The rule-node KIND registry (rule-node-registry R1, ⚖ D1/D2 2026-10-21). One entry per kind a layer emits or handles. Checked by scripts/rules/ruleKindCensus.test.js against the JS engine, the Python layers (rule-kinds.python-vocab.json) and committed presets. A new kind = an entry here; a new gap fails the census by name; known_gaps may only SHRINK (gap_ceiling). Policy for unknown kinds: docs/json/developer/reference/rule-kind-registry.md.",
 "capabilities": {
  "pure": "needs nothing from the evaluation context beyond its operands and locals",
  "inventory": "reads the player's items, counts or item groups",
  "regions": "reads reachability or checked state of regions, locations or entrances — an inventory-only context must refuse it by name",
  "world": "reads static world data: options, world attributes, player id, placements, region data",
  "helpers": "calls game helper code (the context's executeHelper / state methods); what it needs depends on the helper",
  "tile": "RESERVED for tile-grid state (tile primitives); no kind uses it yet"
 },
